From 943f6037a87da7376999bba26c6b72f8374826a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 11:12:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ADD terminal visual selections for both panes so focused
 text can be yanked

Single-v visual mode tracks a pane-local cursor before a range exists, promotes movement to a character selection, and lets y/Y copy either the immediate focused character, a range, or the focused line through the existing OSC 52 path.
